  lines:
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: The slope ahead is built for sliding. Hold Left Ctrl while moving downhill
      to gain speed.
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 2736272047063480907, guid: ca5a1075237da5545b10438e8106affd, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: Stay in the slide beneath the low gate, then jump from the runway to carry
      that momentum over the gap.
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 2736272047063480907, guid: a6dce48185b1cf24fb9f542767adc9c2, type: 3}
